Z||000043||Raydar||02-03-2001||12:11 PM||||I was in first grade when JFK got shot. Still remember the teacher making the announcement.<BR>Was in 6th grade when we landed on the moon.<BR>Still have the B&W Polaroids that I snapped from the TV screen.<P>Yeah, I remember Jordache jeans, too. I also remember that although they were really expensive, when they got old and faded they looked exactly like old and faded Levi's. Not like that's a <I>bad</I> thing.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P>Anybody know what a "1A3" is? <P>Speaking of the moon landing, I saw a TV program about it a couple of years ago. Seems that the guidance system computer that they used for the lunar lander was the functional  equivalent of a 486!<P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<P>88 T-top Formula<BR>88 soon-to-be-V6 coupe||||reg||1
